{
  "duration": 47.7,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.579,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.059,
      "end": 3.119,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.699,
      "end": 6.319,
      "text": "Now in this problem, we are given that the speed of a train"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.839,
      "end": 8.359,
      "text": "is twenty-five meter per second."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.84,
      "end": 9.579,
      "text": "The question is"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.079,
      "end": 12.599,
      "text": "asking us to find its speed in kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.179,
      "end": 14.019,
      "text": "Now, before solving,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.42,
      "end": 16.479,
      "text": "let us remember one simple conversion."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.039,
      "end": 20.899,
      "text": "One meter per second is equal to eighteen by five kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.279,
      "end": 23.039,
      "text": "This is a direct conversion, so"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.479,
      "end": 26.259,
      "text": "we simply multiply the given speed by eighteen by five."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.579,
      "end": 27.92,
      "text": "Now, let us put the values."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.359,
      "end": 32.719,
      "text": "Speed in kilometer per hour is equal to twenty-five into eighteen by five."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.2,
      "end": 36.979,
      "text": "Since twenty-five is divisible by five, we get five into eighteen."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.439,
      "end": 40.099,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get ninety kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.68,
      "end": 44.919,
      "text": "Done and dusted. So the speed of the train is ninety kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.34,
      "end": 47.7,
      "text": "Hence, the correct answer is option A."
    }
  ],
